from lesson_helpers import example as ex
DATA={
'sha':'283f3965f944ef3943e22e8896a2c72dc21017dd','colour':'#b14e40','first':'ResistorReplacement',
'subtitle':('以名义对照理解可故障化元件：从替换、激活到多物理域后果','Understand fault-capable components through nominal comparisons: replacement, activation and multi-domain consequences'),
'intro':[
('MSLFaults 在与 Modelica Standard Library 元件对应的结构中提供可选择故障模式的实现。它的主要使用方式是：保留本体的连接与名义参数，只把一个选定元件替换为故障化版本，然后比较无故障、激活、恢复三个阶段。','MSLFaults supplies selectable fault mechanisms in a structure corresponding to Modelica Standard Library components. Its principal workflow preserves host connections and nominal parameters, replaces a selected component, and compares nominal, activated and recovered behaviour.'),
('本指南覆盖电气、转动和平动机械、磁路、热、流体和信号环节。学习时应先比较 MSL 原生元件与 FaultMode.Normal，再研究某一个故障模式，而不是把整个库一次性用于未经检查的复杂本体。','This guide covers electrical, rotational and translational mechanical, magnetic, thermal, fluid and signal components. First compare the native MSL component with FaultMode.Normal, then study one fault mode; do not introduce the entire library into an unchecked complex plant at once.')],
'route':[
('用 ResistorReplacement 识别原生、Normal 和故障支路，并读懂激活与恢复。','Use ResistorReplacement to identify native, Normal and faulted branches and interpret activation and recovery.'),
('学习电容与电感案例，区分参数变化、储能变化和耗散。','Study capacitor and inductor examples, distinguishing parameter variation, stored energy and dissipation.'),
('按自己的物理域选择机械、热、磁路或流体案例，先做解析数量级核对。','Choose a mechanical, thermal, magnetic or fluid example and check analytical orders of magnitude.'),
('最后研究传感与多域案例，在独立研究包中逐项替换元件并保留对照。','Finish with sensing and multi-domain examples, replacing components one at a time in a separate study package.')],
'concepts':[
(('替换是接口与语义的双重约束','Replacement constrains both interface and semantics'),'同名参数或相似图标不保证替换成立。检查物理端口、条件热端口、初始化状态与 nominalCounterpart。若本体使用 replaceable 和 constrainedby，须在目标工具中检查 redeclare 的类型约束；图形上手动替换也要重新核对所有参数。','Similar names or icons do not guarantee compatibility. Check physical connectors, conditional thermal ports, initial states and the nominal counterpart. For replaceable components constrained by a native type, check redeclare compatibility in the target tool; manual graphical replacement also requires parameter review.'),
(('每个类有自己的 FaultMode','Each class declares its own FaultMode'),'故障模式是局部枚举，必须使用本元件完整类型路径。某个电阻有 OpenCircuit，不表示所有传感器或阀门也有同名模式。下方逐元件列出实际枚举，避免依赖通用名称猜测。','Fault modes are local enumerations and must use the component-specific qualified type. An OpenCircuit mode on a resistor does not imply that every sensor or valve declares it. The reference lists each actual enumeration rather than guessing from a universal vocabulary.'),
(('请求、效果和永久状态需要分别解释','Separate request, effect and retained state'),'faultStartTime、faultEndTime、transitionTime 与 severity 共同定义故障作用；有些模式捕获历史值，有些改变内部状态或保留不可逆效果。窗口结束不意味着系统一定回到之前轨迹，也不意味着储能被恢复。','faultStartTime, faultEndTime, transitionTime and severity jointly define an intervention. Some modes capture historical values; others alter or retain internal state. Closing the fault window does not guarantee a return to the earlier trajectory or restoration of stored energy.'),
(('传感器读数不是物理真值','A sensor reading is not physical truth'),'传感故障可能只改变读数，不改变被测支路电流、压力或转速。研究反馈后果时必须让控制器使用故障化读数，同时把本体真值留作独立观察；开环传感案例只展示读数机制。','A sensor fault may alter only the reported value, leaving physical current, pressure or speed unchanged. To study feedback consequences, drive the controller from the faulted reading and preserve physical truth independently. An open-loop sensor example demonstrates the reporting mechanism only.'),
(('时变储能参数不只有损耗','Variable storage parameters involve more than loss'),'C、L、m、J 或弹簧刚度变化会改变能量表达。若实现提供 storedEnergy、lossPower 或 parameterPower，应分别检查：热耗散与因参数变化交换的功率不能直接混为一谈。有限过渡可以缓和数值突变，但不能替代对故障物理假设的说明。','Changes in C, L, m, J or stiffness alter energy relations. Where provided, inspect storedEnergy, lossPower and parameterPower separately: dissipation and power exchanged through parameter changes are different quantities. Finite transitions can moderate discontinuities but do not replace physical justification.')],
'groups':[
('Blocks',('信号与动态环节','Signal and dynamic blocks'),'用故障版本替换 Gain、FirstOrder、Limiter 或 FixedDelay；保留原名义增益、时间常数及初始化设置。把输入 u 和输出 y 接入原有信号路径，并检查冻结、固定输出与连续状态冻结的差别。','Replace Gain, FirstOrder, Limiter or FixedDelay while preserving nominal gain, time constants and initialisation. Reconnect u and y in the original path and distinguish held inputs, fixed outputs and frozen continuous states.'),
('Electrical.Analog.Basic',('电路基础元件','Basic circuit components'),'保持 p/n 极性与电路参考；按原元件配置 R、G、C、L 或变比。先选 Normal 对照，再选本类 FaultMode；对储能元件同时检查初态、状态变量与参数功率。','Preserve p/n orientation and electrical reference, and retain R, G, C, L or transformation ratio. Compare Normal first, then select the local FaultMode. For storage components, inspect initial states, state variables and parameter power.'),
('Electrical.Analog.Ideal',('理想器件与有限故障近似','Ideal devices and finite fault approximations'),'检查开关命令方向、导通电阻、关断电导及放大器输入/输出端口。失效开路或短路通常需要有限参数；不要假设能在任何理想源组合中无条件工作。','Check switch-command polarity, on-resistance, off-conductance and amplifier ports. Open/short failures generally require finite parameters; do not assume compatibility with every combination of ideal sources.'),
('Electrical.Analog.Semiconductors',('半导体故障机理','Semiconductor fault mechanisms'),'将器件接入完整偏置回路，核对结参数、端子名称与热边界。先选小型直流或瞬态工况；NPNFaultStage 属于局部机理辅助，不应当作完整独立实验。','Connect the device in a complete bias circuit and check junction parameters, terminal names and thermal boundaries. Begin with a small DC or transient experiment. NPNFaultStage supports a local mechanism rather than a complete stand-alone experiment.'),
('Electrical.Analog.Sensors',('电气测量故障','Electrical sensing faults'),'电流类按测量定义串入，电压类跨接被测节点。观察 reported 输出与真实支路量，确认控制器接到需要研究的读数路径，而不是无故障旁路。','Insert current sensing and connect voltage sensing according to their measurement definitions. Compare reported and physical quantities and ensure the controller uses the intended measurement path.'),
('Electrical.Analog.Sources',('源输出故障','Source-output faults'),'保留原波形幅值、频率和起始时刻，再设置源本身的幅值、偏置、时序或丢失模式。注意理想源与外部网络之间的约束冲突，必要时建立实际有限阻抗。','Retain nominal waveform amplitude, frequency and timing before selecting source amplitude, offset, timing or loss modes. Check ideal-source constraints against the external network and introduce physically justified finite impedance where required.'),
('Mechanics.Rotational',('转动元件与传感','Rotational components and sensing'),'确认 flange_a/flange_b 正方向、支撑端和相对量。惯量、刚度、阻尼、摩擦、齿隙与制动故障作用不同；用转速、相对角、转矩和耗散解释，不要只看一个报警量。','Check flange orientation, support and relative quantities. Inertia, stiffness, damping, friction, backlash and braking faults have different effects. Interpret speed, relative angle, torque and dissipation rather than a single alarm.'),
('Mechanics.Translational',('平动元件与传感','Translational components and sensing'),'保留质量、弹簧自由长度、摩擦及限位初始条件，检查运动正方向和参考支撑。质量变化主要影响动态，刚度变化还影响静态位移；须分别做对照。','Preserve mass, spring free length, friction and stop initial conditions and check motion direction and support. Mass variation primarily affects dynamics, while stiffness also changes static displacement; compare these separately.'),
('Magnetic.FluxTubes',('集总磁路','Lumped magnetic circuits'),'形成闭合磁路并建立磁势参考，明确磁阻/磁导、漏磁和电磁转换匝数。传感读数故障与磁路机理故障不可互换；有效匝数变化需要检查电侧与磁侧能量关系。','Form a closed magnetic circuit with a potential reference and declare reluctance/permeance, leakage and converter turns. Sensor errors and circuit faults are different mechanisms. Check electrical–magnetic energy relations when effective turns vary.'),
('Thermal.HeatTransfer',('热容量与传热退化','Thermal storage and heat-transfer degradation'),'连接热容量、环境及热流边界，使用 K。区分容量变化与传热能力变化：前者改变惯性，后者通常也改变稳态温升。可选热端口必须明确连接。','Connect thermal storage, environment and heat-flow boundaries using kelvin. Capacity variation changes thermal inertia; transfer variation generally also changes steady temperature rise. Connect every enabled conditional heat port.'),
('Thermal.FluidHeatFlow',('简化热流体网络','Simplified thermal-fluid networks'),'采用该子库自己的接口、介质参数和参考网络，不要直接与 Modelica.Fluid 的 stream 端口混接。传感输出、管阻和阀动作分别验证。','Use this sublibrary’s own interfaces, medium parameters and references; do not directly mix them with Modelica.Fluid stream connectors. Verify sensor output, resistance and valve action separately.'),
('Fluid',('流体机件与传感','Fluid machinery and sensing'),'统一 Medium，配置 inner Modelica.Fluid.System 及足够边界。泵、管、阀的故障要与介质工况一致；检查 flow reversal、初始压力/温度与流出状态，先在单支路验证。','Use a consistent Medium, inner Modelica.Fluid.System and sufficient boundaries. Match pump, pipe and valve faults to medium conditions. Check flow reversal, initial pressure/temperature and stream-state semantics in a single branch first.')],
'examples':{
'ResistorReplacement':ex(('电阻与电导的三支路比较','Three-way resistor and conductor comparison'),('故障替换是否保留名义行为，并在指定时段产生可恢复变化？','Does replacement preserve nominal behaviour and produce the scheduled reversible change?'),('原生、Normal、故障电阻各构成独立 12 V 回路；R 从 10 变到 20 Ω。电导对照从 0.1 变到 0.05 S。','Native, Normal and faulted resistors form separate 12 V circuits; R changes from 10 to 20 ohms. The corresponding conductance changes from 0.1 to 0.05 S.'),('名义电流为 1.2 A，故障平台为 0.6 A。默认故障请求从 1 到 3 s，0.05 s 过渡使平台和恢复需要有限时间；比较 native 与 normal 是否重合。','Nominal current is 1.2 A and the fault plateau 0.6 A. The default request spans 1–3 s with a 0.05 s transition, so the plateau and recovery take finite time. Compare native and Normal traces.'),['resistorNativeCurrent','resistorNormalCurrent','resistorFaultCurrent','conductorNativeCurrent','conductorNormalCurrent','conductorFaultCurrent'],('只改变 R_step 或 faultStartTime，分别观察故障幅值和发生时刻。','Change R_step or faultStartTime separately to examine magnitude and timing.'),('这是固定理想电压源边界下的机制比较，不是所有供电拓扑的验证。','This is a mechanism comparison under a fixed ideal voltage boundary, not validation of every supply topology.')),
'CapacitorDegradation':ex(('容量下降与 RC 充电','Capacitance loss and RC charging'),('容量下降怎样影响充电速度，运行中变容又该怎样解释？','How does capacitance loss affect charging, and how should a change during operation be interpreted?'),('三套相同 RC 回路比较原生、Normal 和 CapacitanceLoss。dynamicLoss=false 时从初始即故障；true 时在 1 s 后用 0.2 s 过渡改变容量。','Three identical RC circuits compare native, Normal and CapacitanceLoss. With dynamicLoss=false the fault is present initially; true introduces it after 1 s through a 0.2 s transition.'),('默认故障降低容量，因此相同电阻和供电下充电更快。动态变容时应同时检查电压、电荷和储能，不能只把变容造成的功率项当成热损耗。','Reduced capacitance charges more rapidly with the same resistance and supply. During a dynamic change inspect voltage, charge and stored energy; power associated with changing capacitance is not automatically heat loss.'),['nativeValue','normalValue','faultedValue'],('先保持 dynamicLoss=false 对照时间常数，再打开 dynamicLoss 并比较过渡区。','Compare time constants with dynamicLoss=false, then enable dynamicLoss and inspect the transition.'),('模型中的容量损失是假设的等效机理；真实损伤过程需要额外物理依据。','Capacitance loss is an assumed equivalent mechanism; a real damage process requires additional physical justification.')),
'InductorDegradation':ex(('电感下降与 RL 电流','Inductance loss and RL current'),('较小电感为什么改变暂态而不必改变最终直流电流？','Why can reduced inductance change the transient without changing final DC current?'),('三套回路只在电感实现与故障设置上不同，故障从初始化生效，电源与电阻保持相同。','Three circuits differ only in inductor implementation and fault configuration. The fault is active initially while source and resistance remain unchanged.'),('故障电流建立更快；稳定直流电流仍由供电和电阻决定。对照 nativeValue 与 normalValue，并检查故障支路初期变化速率。','The faulted current establishes more rapidly, while steady DC current is determined by supply and resistance. Compare nativeValue with normalValue and inspect the early faulted slope.'),['nativeValue','normalValue','faultedValue'],('在独立副本中改变故障后的电感或激活时刻，比较磁链连续性与电流响应。','In a separate copy, vary the faulted inductance or activation time and compare flux-linkage continuity and current response.'),('带电状态下的参数突变与从初始使用较小电感不是同一个实验。','Changing inductance while energised is not the same experiment as starting with a smaller inductance.')),
'MagneticReluctance':ex(('磁阻增加与磁通','Reluctance increase and magnetic flux'),('固定磁势下的磁阻变化能否直接做数量级核对？','Can reluctance variation under fixed magnetomotive force be checked analytically?'),('100 A·turn 磁势驱动原生、Normal 和故障磁阻支路；名义磁阻 1000，故障值 2000。','A 100 ampere-turn source drives native, Normal and faulted reluctance branches. Nominal reluctance is 1000 and the fault value 2000.'),('按磁通=磁势/磁阻，名义磁通应为 0.1 Wb，故障为 0.05 Wb。Normal 应保持名义对照。','Using flux=magnetomotive force/reluctance, nominal flux should be 0.1 Wb and faulted flux 0.05 Wb. Normal should match the nominal counterpart.'),['nativeValue','normalValue','faultedValue'],('将 R_mFault 改为 4000，核对磁通是否约为 0.025 Wb。','Set R_mFault to 4000 and check for approximately 0.025 Wb.'),('线性集总磁路的比较不代表已经考虑材料饱和、空间漏磁或温度耦合。','A linear lumped comparison does not establish material saturation, spatial leakage or temperature coupling.')),
'RotationalDamping':ex(('阻尼、惯量与弹簧的不同后果','Different consequences of damping, inertia and stiffness'),('哪些故障改变转速平台，哪些主要改变响应速度？','Which faults change the speed plateau and which primarily change response speed?'),('1 N·m 恒转矩驱动 J=0.1、d=0.1 的转动支路。独立故障支路增大阻尼或把惯量改为 0.05；另有同角位移输入的弹簧对照，故障刚度为 5。','A constant 1 N m drives a branch with J=0.1 and d=0.1. Independent branches increase damping or reduce inertia to 0.05. A separate spring comparison uses the same imposed angle and fault stiffness 5.'),('名义速度趋近 10 rad/s。增加阻尼降低速度平台；减小惯量加快响应但不改变由转矩/阻尼决定的平台。规定相同角位移时，较软弹簧产生较小转矩。','Nominal speed tends towards 10 rad/s. Increased damping lowers the plateau; reduced inertia accelerates response without changing the torque/damping plateau. A softer spring produces less torque for the same imposed angle.'),['nativeSpeed','normalSpeed','dampingFaultSpeed','inertiaFaultSpeed','nativeSpringTorque','normalSpringTorque','faultSpringTorque'],('比较各支路最终值与到达平台的速度，再分别修改 JFault 和 dIncrease。','Compare final values and approach rates, then vary JFault and dIncrease independently.'),('弹簧支路与驱动支路是独立实验，不能把它们误读成同一传动链。','The spring and drive branches are separate experiments, not one transmission chain.')),
'TranslationalStiffness':ex(('质量—弹簧—阻尼的参数辨别','Distinguishing mass, stiffness and damping effects'),('怎样从静态位移与动态振荡区分三类故障？','How can static displacement and transient oscillation distinguish three fault types?'),('1 N 恒力驱动 m=1、c=100、d=2 的支路；分别比较刚度下降到 50、质量下降到 0.5 和阻尼增加。','A constant 1 N drives m=1, c=100 and d=2. Separate branches reduce stiffness to 50, reduce mass to 0.5 or increase damping.'),('名义静态位移为 0.01 m，刚度减半后为 0.02 m；质量与阻尼变化主要改变振荡和衰减过程，在相同刚度下不改变静态力平衡位移。','Nominal static displacement is 0.01 m and becomes 0.02 m when stiffness halves. Mass and damping primarily alter oscillation and decay; with unchanged stiffness they do not change static force-balance displacement.'),['nativePosition','normalPosition','stiffnessFaultPosition','massFaultPosition','dampingFaultPosition'],('先比较静态位置，再比较峰值和振荡周期，不要只用最后一个时刻评价故障影响。','Compare static position first, then peaks and oscillation period rather than judging the fault from the final sample alone.'),('有限仿真终点未必已经达到静态；应检查残余振荡。','A finite simulation end is not necessarily steady state; inspect residual oscillation.')),
'ThermalDegradation':ex(('传热下降与热容下降','Reduced heat transfer versus reduced thermal capacity'),('为何一种故障提高最终温度，另一种只加快升温？','Why can one fault raise final temperature while another mainly accelerates heating?'),('相同热源和环境下比较热导、热容和对流变化。故障热导为 5、故障热容为 50，对流系数缩放为 0.5，各故障从初始化激活。','With the same heat source and environment, separate branches vary conductance, heat capacity and convection. Fault conductance is 5, capacity 50 and convection scale 0.5, all active initially.'),('传热能力降低会增大相同持续热负荷下的温差；热容量减小主要缩短时间常数。导热与对流的同等有效热导变化应产生可比较的温度趋势。','Reduced transfer increases the temperature difference needed to reject the same sustained heat load. Reduced heat capacity primarily shortens the time constant. Equivalent changes in effective conductive and convective transfer should produce comparable trends.'),['nativeTemperature','normalTemperature','conductanceFaultTemperature','capacityFaultTemperature','nativeConvectionTemperature','normalConvectionTemperature','faultConvectionTemperature'],('保持热源不变，分别改变 GFault、CFault 和 conductanceScaleFault，比较平台与上升速度。','Keep the heat source fixed and vary GFault, CFault and conductanceScaleFault separately, comparing plateaux and rise rates.'),('温度曲线不能单独推断实际材料损坏；仍需允许温度和暴露时长的独立判据。','A temperature trace alone does not establish material damage; allowable temperature and exposure criteria remain separate.')),
'SensorAndSignalFaults':ex(('冻结、固定值与测量偏置','Freezing, fixed values and measurement bias'),('读数异常是否意味着本体物理量也改变？','Does an abnormal reading mean the physical quantity changed?'),('公共斜坡驱动信号与电气测量对照。故障窗口为 [1,2) s；增益和一阶环节冻结，限幅器输出固定 0.25，电流读数卡住，电压读数叠加 1 V。','A common ramp drives signal and electrical-sensing comparisons. Over [1,2) s, gain and first-order paths freeze, the limiter fixes output at 0.25, current sensing sticks and voltage sensing adds 1 V.'),('名义与 Normal 路径应一致；冻结/卡住读数在窗口内不再跟随原输入，电压读数偏移。电路真实电流并不会因为读数保持就自动停止变化。','Native and Normal paths should agree. Held readings stop tracking their original input and voltage reporting shifts. Physical circuit current does not automatically stop changing because a reading is held.'),['nativeSignalGain','normalSignalGain','faultSignalGain','nativeSignalLag','faultSignalLag','nativeSensingCurrent','faultSensingCurrent','faultSensingVoltage'],('延长故障窗，再比较解除时的读数恢复与动态环节内部状态恢复。','Extend the fault window and compare recovery of reported values with recovery of dynamic internal states.'),('该案例没有把所有故障读数反馈到一个控制器，不能直接当作闭环稳定性结论。','Not all faulted readings are fed back to a controller here; this is not a closed-loop stability conclusion.')),
'FluidValveDegradation':ex(('阀能力下降与压力测量偏置','Valve degradation and pressure-sensing bias'),('阀机理故障和传感偏置分别影响什么？','What changes under valve degradation versus sensing bias?'),('三个独立流路比较原生、Normal 与故障阀和压力传感器；执行器增益为 0.5，传感器偏置 1000 Pa。reverseFlow 与 freezeCommand 可切换额外实验条件。','Three independent flow paths compare native, Normal and faulted valves and pressure sensors. Actuator gain is 0.5 and sensing bias 1000 Pa. reverseFlow and freezeCommand select additional configurations.'),('默认恒压差工况下故障阀流量减小，压力读数增加 1000 Pa；反向设置改变有符号流量。冻结开度实验需要检查激活沿捕获值，而非把 FreezeOpening 理解为固定零开度。','Under the default fixed pressure difference, faulted valve flow decreases and pressure reporting increases by 1000 Pa. Reverse flow changes signed flow. FreezeOpening captures its activation-edge opening rather than necessarily forcing zero.'),['nativeFlow','normalFlow','faultedFlow','nativePressure','normalPressure','faultedPressure'],('先只切换 reverseFlow，再恢复默认并打开 freezeCommand；不要同时改变介质与边界。','First change reverseFlow only; then restore defaults and enable freezeCommand, keeping medium and boundaries unchanged.'),('传感器偏置不等于真实容腔压力上升，固定压力边界也不能代表任意供流网络。','Sensor bias is not a physical pressure rise, and fixed-pressure boundaries do not represent every flow network.')),
'ElectromechanicalFaultEffects':ex(('电机多域响应与独立电磁转换','Multi-domain motor response and a separate magnetic converter'),('同一故障怎样在电流、运动和热量上体现？','How does one fault appear in current, motion and temperature?'),('configuration=0/1/2/3 选择正常、绕组电阻、反馈增益或组合故障；另一组独立磁路比较有效匝数损失，dynamicTurns 可在运行中平滑改变匝数。','configuration=0/1/2/3 selects nominal, winding resistance, feedback gain or combined faults. A separate magnetic-circuit group compares effective-turn loss; dynamicTurns permits a smooth change during operation.'),('依次比较电流、转速与温度，不假设电阻增加必然使每项量都同方向变化。磁路对照中的电流与磁通反映转换器参数变化，但该磁路不是电机支路内部磁场。','Compare current, speed and temperature in sequence without assuming that increased resistance changes every quantity in the same direction. The magnetic comparison reflects converter variation but is not the internal field of the motor branch.'),['motorNativeCurrent','motorFaultCurrent','motorNativeSpeed','motorFaultSpeed','motorNativeTemperature','motorFaultTemperature','fluxNativeFlux','fluxFaultFlux'],('依次运行 configuration 0、1、2、3，形成单因素与组合对照；另行切换 dynamicTurns。','Run configurations 0, 1, 2 and 3 for single-factor and combined comparisons, then vary dynamicTurns in a separate study.'),('组合效应一般不能由两个单独差值简单相加，也不能把独立子实验误读成完整电机电磁联合仿真。','Combined effects are not generally the sum of separate differences; independent sub-experiments are not a fully coupled electromagnetic motor simulation.'))
},
'study':[
('从一个已经能正常运行的本体开始，选一个元件建立三套副本：原生、故障版本 Normal、故障激活。除元件实现与目标故障参数外，其余边界和初值保持一致。先把名义差异解释清楚，再研究故障后果。','Begin with a working nominal host and create three copies: native, fault-capable Normal and activated fault. Keep boundaries and initial conditions identical except for implementation and target fault parameters. Explain nominal discrepancies before interpreting fault consequences.'),
('下方教学模型直接实例化可故障电阻。对于现有 replaceable 工程，应参考库内例子的 redeclare 写法并检查类型约束，不要把文件名替换当成完成语义替换。','The teaching model below directly instantiates a fault-capable resistor. In an existing replaceable design, follow the examples’ redeclare pattern and check type constraints; replacing a filename is not a semantic replacement.')],
'snippet':'''within;
model MyResistorStudy
  Modelica.Electrical.Analog.Sources.ConstantVoltage supply(V=12);
  Modelica.Electrical.Analog.Basic.Ground ground;
  MSLFaults.Electrical.Analog.Basic.FaultableResistor device(
    R=10,
    faultMode=MSLFaults.Electrical.Analog.Basic.FaultableResistor.FaultMode.ResistanceStep,
    R_step=20, faultStartTime=1, faultEndTime=3, transitionTime=0.05);
equation
  connect(supply.p, device.p);
  connect(device.n, supply.n);
  connect(supply.n, ground.p);
  annotation(experiment(StopTime=5, Tolerance=1e-6));
end MyResistorStudy;''',
 'trouble':[
(('Normal 与原生不重合','Normal differs from the native component'),'先核对所有名义参数、初态、条件热端口和边界。某些替换使用正则化或有限失效参数；先阅读该类实现，再判断是否存在需要报告的问题。','Check nominal parameters, initial states, conditional thermal ports and boundaries. Some replacements use regularisation or finite failure parameters; inspect the implementation before diagnosing a discrepancy.'),
(('某个 FaultMode 无法选择','A FaultMode cannot be selected'),'枚举来自具体类，不是库级通用 FaultMode。复制其他元件的枚举路径会产生类型错误；以本卡列出的实际成员为准。','The enumeration belongs to a specific class, not a universal library type. Copying another component’s enumeration path causes a type mismatch; use the declared members.'),
(('恢复后曲线没有回到原位置','Recovery does not restore the original trajectory'),'状态量已经积累了不同的电荷、磁链、速度、位移或热量。恢复参数只恢复关系，不会自动重置整个系统历史。','Charge, flux linkage, speed, displacement or heat may have evolved differently. Restoring a parameter restores a relation, not the complete system history.'),
(('可以说该库覆盖了所有故障吗','Does the library cover all failures?'),'不能。覆盖范围是源码实际声明的模式与建模假设；目录验证标签也不能替代具体模式、工况、工具和参数范围的运行证据。','No. Coverage is limited to declared modes and modelling assumptions. Catalogue labels do not replace execution evidence for a particular mode, condition, tool and parameter range.')]
}
